{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55353","headline":"题锺隐画鶡子鸟 · 金昌宗","name":"题锺隐画鶡子鸟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多厌翻翔下苇丛，戢翰侧脑思何穷？\n侍童莫便褰帘过，只恐惊飞入碧空。\n（见宋刘道醇《五代名画补遗》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"金昌宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}